    <bpmn:process id="W_W5099" name="W5099. Consumables Yield, Print-Cost Accounting &amp; Margin Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly analytics; costing cycle; margin review
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~all jobs × cost
Owner: Analytics/FP&amp;A (VS-28/VS-17.4) / Director Store Services
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), Inventory (VS-05), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Store Services Lead, Cost Accounting (VS-158)
Source: workflow W5099 — Consumables Yield, Print-Cost Accounting &amp; Margin Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5099_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5099_Lane1" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5099_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5099_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5099_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5099_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5099_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5099_Start3" name="Monthly analytics; costing cycle; margin review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5099_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5099_Task4" name="Track consumables yield: ink/media consumption per sqm/job, yield variance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Track consumables yield: ink/media consumption per sqm/job, yield variance, waste %, and consumables inventory accuracy (W5084)
Responsible (R): Analytics / Inventory
Accountable (A): Director Store Services
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5099_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5099_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5099_Task5" name="Cost-account each job: media + ink + machine + labor + overhead per job…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Cost-account each job: media + ink + machine + labor + overhead per job (cost-per-sqm — W5083), landed cost of consumables (VS-158), and waste cost
Responsible (R): Analytics / Cost Accounting / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Director Store Services
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5099_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5099_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5099_Task6" name="Analyse margin &amp; act: gross margin by service/media/site, feed pricing (W5083)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Analyse margin &amp; act: gross margin by service/media/site, feed pricing (W5083), consumables sourcing (W5084), and FP&amp;A (VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): Analytics / FP&amp;A / Pricing
Accountable (A): Director Store Services
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5099_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5099_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5099_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
