        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-760 (ensure controlled execution — Print Quality, Compliance, Document Security &amp; Analytics (PA-176.3).) | - CTL-760: consumables reconciled to jobs (W5084); cost-per-sqm validated (VS-158); margin reconciled (VS-17.4)
Owner: Analytics/FP&amp;A (VS-28/VS-17.4) / Director Store Services</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
