      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer complaint/defect; VOC; rework
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~10–30 complaint/rework cases per year
Owner: Customer Service (VS-13) / Store Services Lead
Participants: Customer Service (VS-13), Store Services Lead, Operator/Quality, CX assurance (VS-146)
Source: workflow W5102 — Reprographics Customer Satisfaction, Complaint &amp; Rework Management</bpmn:documentation>
