        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-760 (ensure controlled execution — Print Quality, Compliance, Document Security &amp; Analytics (PA-176.3).) | - CTL-760: SLA + escalation (VS-13); refunds O2C-controlled (VS-16); systemic defects fed to program (W5104)
Owner: Customer Service (VS-13) / Store Services Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
