Volume: ~15–25 service sites × demand forecast
Owner: Analytics/Store Ops (VS-28/VS-07) / Director Store Services
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), Store Ops (VS-07), Trade Pro (VS-43), S&amp;OP (VS-127), HR/Staffing (VS-19.3)
