    <bpmn:process id="W_W5104" name="W5104. Reprographics Program Performance, ROI &amp; Cross-Sell Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Executive review; annual strategy (W5081)
Frequency: Quarterly/annual
Volume: 1 program × all service sites
Owner: Director Store Services / FP&amp;A (VS-17.4)
Participants: FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Analytics (VS-28), Trade Pro (VS-43), Strategy (VS-33), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W5104 — Reprographics Program Performance, ROI &amp; Cross-Sell Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5104_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5104_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5104_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5104_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5104_Lane2" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5104_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5104_Lane3" name="Director Store Services">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5104_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5104_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5104_Start5" name="Executive review; annual strategy (W5081)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5104_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5104_Task6" name="Measure program ROI &amp; P&amp;L: revenue, gross margin, equipment/utilization…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Measure program ROI &amp; P&amp;L: revenue, gross margin, equipment/utilization, operating cost, and program P&amp;L vs business case (W5081)
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / Analytics / Director Store Services
Accountable (A): Director Store Services / CFO
Duration: Quarterly/Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5104_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5104_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5104_Task7" name="Quantify cross-sell &amp; attach: reprographics→trade-pro/B2B account linkage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quantify cross-sell &amp; attach: reprographics→trade-pro/B2B account linkage (VS-43/VS-107), bid-set→project-win correlation, and store-traffic/dwell lift
Responsible (R): Analytics / Trade Pro / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Director Store Services
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5104_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5104_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5104_Task8" name="Steer &amp; improve: site expansion/pause/exit, pricing/yield (W5083), capacity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Steer &amp; improve: site expansion/pause/exit, pricing/yield (W5083), capacity (W5098), corrective from complaints (W5102), and strategy refresh (W5081)
Responsible (R): Director Store Services / Strategy / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Director Store Services / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5104_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5104_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5104_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5104_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-760 (ensure controlled execution — Print Quality, Compliance, Document Security &amp; Analytics (PA-176.3).) | - CTL-760: program P&amp;L reconciled to FP&amp;A (VS-17.4); capex within VS-35 envelope; cross-sell measured consistently
Owner: Director Store Services / FP&amp;A (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
